1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,860
Ini rumus ampuh

2
00:00:00,860 --> 00:00:02,240
agar doa kamu gampang

3
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,080
dikabulkan oleh Allah.

4
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:04,040
Caranya, gabungkan

5
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,200
bacaan zikir ini

6
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:05,990
dengan doa permintaan kamu.

7
00:00:05,990 --> 00:00:06,840
Sebab Nabi

8
00:00:06,840 --> 00:00:07,360
shallallāhu ‘alaihi wa sallam

9
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:08,220
sendiri yang bersabda

10
00:00:08,220 --> 00:00:09,180
di dalam hadis shahih:

11
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:10,780
“Jika zikir ini digunakan

12
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:11,490
untuk meminta,

13
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,580
niscaya akan diberi.

14
00:00:12,580 --> 00:00:13,670
Dan jika digunakan

15
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:14,380
untuk berdoa,

16
00:00:14,380 --> 00:00:15,220
niscaya dikabulkan.”

17
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:16,560
Jadi, sebelum meminta apapun,

18
00:00:16,560 --> 00:00:17,660
baca zikir ini

19
00:00:17,660 --> 00:00:17,970
terlebih dahulu.

20
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:20,880
Allāhumma innī as-aluka bi-annī asyhadu

21
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:23,360
annaka antallāh, lā ilāha illā anta,

22
00:00:23,360 --> 00:00:24,950
al-aḥad ash-shamad,

23
00:00:24,950 --> 00:00:26,820
alladzī lam yalid wa lam yūlad,

24
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:28,650
wa lam yakun lahū kufuwan aḥad.

25
00:00:28,650 --> 00:00:30,380
Nah, setelah membaca zikir tadi,

26
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,490
baru langsung panjatkan

27
00:00:31,490 --> 00:00:32,220
doa-doa dan hajat kita.

28
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,400
Semoga Allah mengabulkannya.
